WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:16.000
Move to the coast

00:16.000 --> 00:30.000
More growth can mean more organic matter

00:30.000 --> 00:44.000
Predict four nutrient additions

00:44.000 --> 01:24.000
Follow the factorial experiment

01:24.000 --> 01:52.000
A ratio is a clue, not a diagnosis

01:52.000 --> 02:08.000
Keep organic loading the same

02:08.000 --> 02:52.000
Respiration competes with oxygen renewal

02:52.000 --> 03:20.000
Test the chain from enrichment to oxygen loss
